摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Kuikly DeepSeek Harness plugin that turns your AI agent into a Kuikly cross-platform app development expert.","id":"gh:1338344149","install_available":true,"language":"Kotlin","name":"dsh-kuikly-expert","slug":"Tencent-TDS/dsh-kuikly-expert","topics":["app","cross-platform","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","kuikly"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Kuikly DeepSeek Harness plugin that turns your AI agent into a Kuikly cross-platform app development"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"eepSeek Harness plugin that turns your AI agent into a Kuikly cross-platform app development expert."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# Kuikly Expert — four Kuikly skills for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"Kuikly is Tencent's Kotlin Multiplatform UI framework targeting Android, iOS, HarmonyOS, H5, and min"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"i-programs. This package ships four Kuikly skill bundles as a **DeepSeek Harness (dsh) plugin** — in"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"stall it once, and your dsh agent gains cross-platform Kuikly development knowledge: project scaffol"},{"id":"p4s4","text":"ding, UI framework API reference, building, and on-device preview."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Scaffolding, building, and previewing stay with the upstream `@kuikly-ai/create-kuikly-app` CLI. The"},{"id":"p5s2","text":" skill bodies instruct the model to invoke it through the ordinary shell tool, so this plugin contri"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"butes knowledge rather than a competing tool surface, and a CLI release ships without a harness chan"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"es knowledge rather than a competing tool surface, and a CLI release ships without a harness change."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"> Powered by KuiklyUI, the Kotlin Multiplatform UI framework."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## What is Kuikly Expert?"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Four bundled skills that give a DeepSeek Harness agent Kuikly cross-platform development knowledge:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **kuikly-integration** — scaffolding a KMP project, or adding the Kuikly renderer to an existing A"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"ndroid/iOS/HarmonyOS host\n- **kuikly-app-builder** — project creation, page and component scaffolds,"},{"id":"p9s3","text":" building, and on-device preview\n- **kuikly-ui-framework** — component, module, and public-class API"},{"id":"p9s4","text":" reference for the classic Kuikly DSL (`attr{}` / `event{}`)\n- **kuikly-compose-ui-framework** — com"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"ponent, Modifier, state, and navigation reference for the Compose DSL (`@Composable`)"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Each skill is a single-level directory bundle (`<name>/SKILL.md`) whose `references/` subtree stays "},{"id":"p10s2","text":"out of catalog discovery. The registry supplies a `directory` resource base, so relative paths insid"},{"id":"p10s3","text":"e a skill body resolve against the skill's own directory and the model reads reference documents onl"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"y when a task needs them."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Kuikly dsh plugin: your cross-platform app development expert"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- **Create a cross-platform app with multi-device preview** — say \"create an app\", the agent loads `"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"kuikly-app-builder`, scaffolds a project via `create-kuikly-app`, and you can build and preview on A"},{"id":"p12s3","text":"ndroid, iOS, or HarmonyOS devices — from project creation to on-device preview in one flow.\n- **Add "},{"id":"p12s4","text":"Kuikly to an existing project** — you have an existing Android, iOS, or HarmonyOS project, the agent"},{"id":"p12s5","text":" loads `kuikly-integration`, walks you through renderer dependency setup, container implementation, "},{"id":"p12s6","text":"adapter configuration, and TestPage verification — no need to piece together docs yourself.\n- **Writ"},{"id":"p12s7","text":"e business pages with Kuikly** — you want to write a login page, the agent loads `kuikly-compose-ui-"},{"id":"p12s8","text":"framework`, helping you write runnable code faster and better."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"**DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`)** — install the bundle into the profile you boot, then restart `dsh`:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Then restart `dsh`. Do NOT also run `npx skills add` — the bundle already publishes these skills."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"See INSTALL.md for the full setup walkthrough."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"**From a tarball** — if you prefer not to install from GitHub:"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"## Stay Connected"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Scan the QR codes below to follow our latest updates or contact us for inquiries."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"TDS WeChat Official Account"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"TDS Framework WeChat Official Account"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Online Support"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Questions, feedback, or suggestions? Join the Kuikly developer community:"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- **GitHub Issues**: Tencent-TDS/KuiklyUI/issues\n- **KuiklyUI repo**: Tencent-TDS/KuiklyUI"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"KuiklyUI-AI. See LICENSE for details."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
